  "gameSignScenario1_1_0Prompt": "A sign warning of a crossing with a barrier?",
  "gameSignScenario1_1_0Explanation": "Yes. Ahead is a railway crossing with a barrier.",
  "gameSignScenario1_1_1Prompt": "Is it possible to overtake 80 meters before the crossing?",
  "gameSignScenario1_1_1Explanation": "No. Overtaking is prohibited at a crossing and 100 m before it (clause 11.4).",
  "gameSignScenario1_1_2Prompt": "Can I park my car 30 meters from the crossing?",
  "gameSignScenario1_1_2Explanation": "No. Parking is prohibited closer than 50 m from the crossing (clause 12.5).",
  "gameSignScenario1_2_0Prompt": "Is there a crossing ahead without a barrier?",
  "gameSignScenario1_2_0Explanation": "Yes. The sign warns about crossing without a barrier.",
  "gameSignScenario1_2_1Prompt": "Can I turn around at the crossing?",
  "gameSignScenario1_2_1Explanation": "No. At the crossing, turning and reversing are prohibited (clauses 8.11–8.12).",
  "gameSignScenario1_3_1_0Prompt": "Is there only one railway track at the crossing?",
  "gameSignScenario1_3_1_0Explanation": "Yes. This sign indicates a crossing with one path, without a barrier.",
  "gameSignScenario1_3_1_1Prompt": "Is this sign placed 150–300 m before the crossing?",
  "gameSignScenario1_3_1_1Explanation": "No. Sign 1.3.1 is placed immediately before the crossing.",
  "gameSignScenario1_5_0Prompt": "The tram crosses the road outside the intersection, not from the depot. Should I give in?",
  "gameSignScenario1_5_0Explanation": "Yes. Outside the intersection, the tram has priority except for leaving the depot (clause 18.1).",
  "gameSignScenario1_5_1Prompt": "The tram leaves the depot. Should it give way to cars?",
  "gameSignScenario1_5_1Explanation": "Yes. When leaving the depot, the tram gives way to other vehicles (clause 18.1).",
  "gameSignScenario1_6_0Prompt": "Without a traffic light at an equivalent intersection, do you need to give way to the car on the right?",
  "gameSignScenario1_6_0Explanation": "Yes. At an uncontrolled intersection of equal significance, give way to cars on the right (clause 13.11).",
  "gameSignScenario1_6_1Prompt": "Is it possible to overtake at an equivalent intersection without a traffic light?",
  "gameSignScenario1_6_1Explanation": "No. At an uncontrolled intersection, overtaking is allowed only when driving on the main road (clause 11.4).",
  "gameSignScenario1_7_0Prompt": "Is there a roundabout ahead?",
  "gameSignScenario1_7_0Explanation": "Yes. A sign warns you when approaching a roundabout.",
  "gameSignScenario1_7_1Prompt": "Does the roundabout start right at this sign?",
  "gameSignScenario1_7_1Explanation": "No. This is a warning. The direction of movement on the circle itself is set by sign 4.3.",
  "gameSignScenario1_11_1_0Prompt": "Is it possible to turn around if the road is only visible at 70 m?",
  "gameSignScenario1_11_1_0Explanation": "No. To turn around, visibility must be at least 100 m in each direction (clause 8.11).",
  "gameSignScenario1_11_1_1Prompt": "Before a dangerous turn, should you choose a safe speed?",
  "gameSignScenario1_11_1_1Explanation": "Yes. The speed is chosen taking into account the turn and visibility of the road (clause 10.1).",
  "gameSignScenario1_23_0Prompt": "Could children suddenly come onto the road here?",
  "gameSignScenario1_23_0Explanation": "Yes. The sign warns of an area where children may appear on the road.",
  "gameSignScenario1_23_1Prompt": "Does this sign allow children to cross the road anywhere?",
  "gameSignScenario1_23_1Explanation": "No. The sign warns drivers, but does not change the rules for crossing the road.",
  "gameSignScenario1_25_0Prompt": "A temporary sign on a yellow background is more important than a permanent one if they conflict?",
  "gameSignScenario1_25_0Explanation": "Yes. If there is a contradiction between temporary and permanent signs, the temporary requirement is fulfilled.",
  "gameSignScenario1_25_1Prompt": "Do you have to stop at a road works sign?",
  "gameSignScenario1_25_1Explanation": "No. The sign itself does not require stopping. You need to take roadworks into account and choose a safe speed.",
  "gameSignScenario2_1_0Prompt": "Without a traffic light, do you have the right of way over a car with a second priority?",
  "gameSignScenario2_1_0Explanation": "Yes. At an uncontrolled intersection, the main road gives priority over the secondary one (clause 13.9).",
  "gameSignScenario2_1_1Prompt": "Is it possible to drive on a red light if you are on the main road?",
  "gameSignScenario2_1_1Explanation": "No. At a signalized intersection, you must follow the traffic lights (clause 6.15).",
  "gameSignScenario2_1_2Prompt": "Is it possible to park a car on the roadway of a main road outside a populated area?",
  "gameSignScenario2_1_2Explanation": "No. On such roads, parking on the roadway outside a populated area is prohibited (clause 12.5).",
  "gameSignScenario2_2_0Prompt": "Does the sign mark the end of the main road?",
  "gameSignScenario2_2_0Explanation": "Yes. The advantage that the “Main Road” sign gave is ending.",
  "gameSignScenario2_2_1Prompt": "Does this sign itself require you to stop?",
  "gameSignScenario2_2_1Explanation": "No. It revokes the main road status. The order of travel is determined by other signs and rules.",
  "gameSignScenario2_3_1_0Prompt": "Without a traffic light, should a car from the road you are crossing have to give way to you?",
  "gameSignScenario2_3_1_0Explanation": "Yes. The sign shows the intersection of the main road with the secondary one (clause 13.9).",
  "gameSignScenario2_3_1_1Prompt": "Without a traffic light, do you need to give way to a car on the right from a secondary road?",
  "gameSignScenario2_3_1_1Explanation": "No. You have the advantage: you are on the main road. The “interference from the right” rule does not apply here.",
  "gameSignScenario2_4_0Prompt": "Without a traffic light, do you need to give way to cars on the road you are crossing?",
  "gameSignScenario2_4_0Explanation": "Yes. The sign requires you to yield to cars on the road you are crossing. At the sign 8.13 - cars on the main road.",
  "gameSignScenario2_4_1Prompt": "The road is clear. Do you still need to stop at this sign?",
  "gameSignScenario2_4_1Explanation": "No. There is no mandatory stop if you are not disturbing anyone.",
  "gameSignScenario2_4_2Prompt": "Both are on the secondary road: you are straight, oncoming traffic is to the left. Should he give in?",
  "gameSignScenario2_4_2Explanation": "Yes. With equal priority, an oncoming car turning left gives way to the one going straight (clause 13.12).",
  "gameSignScenario2_5_0Prompt": "Do you need to stop before STOP, even if the road is clear?",
  "gameSignScenario2_5_0Explanation": "Yes. Stop in front of the stop line, and if there is none, in front of the edge of the roadway you are crossing. At a crossing without a stop line - in front of the sign.",
  "gameSignScenario2_5_1Prompt": "Is it possible to drive STOP without stopping if everything is clearly visible?",
  "gameSignScenario2_5_1Explanation": "No. The sign requires a complete stop even when the road is clear.",
  "gameSignScenario2_6_0Prompt": "The entry will interfere with the oncoming car. Should I give in?",
  "gameSignScenario2_6_0Explanation": "Yes. You must not drive into a narrow area if it will impede oncoming traffic.",
  "gameSignScenario2_6_1Prompt": "Does this sign give you an advantage over people you meet?",
  "gameSignScenario2_6_1Explanation": "No. Oncoming traffic has the right of way.",
  "gameSignScenario2_7_0Prompt": "Do you have an advantage in a narrow area?",
  "gameSignScenario2_7_0Explanation": "Yes. This sign gives you an advantage over oncoming cars.",
  "gameSignScenario2_7_1Prompt": "Does this sign give an oncoming car the right of way?",
  "gameSignScenario2_7_1Explanation": "No. Transport moving in your direction has priority.",
  "gameSignScenario3_1_0Prompt": "Is this sign prohibiting entry for regular taxis?",
  "gameSignScenario3_1_0Explanation": "Yes. Taxis and car sharing must comply with the ban. The exception is route transport.",
  "gameSignScenario3_1_1Prompt": "Can you move in just because you live behind the sign?",
  "gameSignScenario3_1_1Explanation": "No. There is no exception for residents. Do not confuse this sign with the \"No Traffic\" sign.",
  "gameSignScenario3_1_2Prompt": "Can a shuttle bus enter on its route?",
  "gameSignScenario3_1_2Explanation": "Yes. The prohibition of this sign does not apply to route vehicles.",
  "gameSignScenario3_2_0Prompt": "Can you drive to your home in the area of ​​this sign?",
  "gameSignScenario3_2_0Explanation": "Yes. Residents are allowed access to the house. You need to enter and exit at the intersection closest to it.",
  "gameSignScenario3_2_1Prompt": "Is it possible to drive through this zone in a regular car?",
  "gameSignScenario3_2_1Explanation": "No. The sign prohibits movement. The passage of residents and service vehicles are exceptions to access to the destination.",
  "gameSignScenario3_2_2Prompt": "A sign prohibits passage for a driver with a group I disability and a “Disabled” sign?",
  "gameSignScenario3_2_2Explanation": "No. The sign does not apply to cars of drivers with disabilities of groups I–II or those transporting them and disabled children with the “Disabled” sign.",
  "gameSignScenario3_4_0Prompt": "Is this sign prohibiting the movement of passenger cars?",
  "gameSignScenario3_4_0Explanation": "No. It restricts the movement of trucks, tractors and self-propelled vehicles.",
  "gameSignScenario3_4_1Prompt": "Is it possible for an ordinary truck with a permissible weight of 5 tons to pass this sign?",
  "gameSignScenario3_4_1Explanation": "Yes. The sign shown indicates a threshold of 8 tons. The permissible maximum weight of 5 tons does not exceed this.",
  "gameSignScenario3_18_1_0Prompt": "Is this sign prohibiting left turns?",
  "gameSignScenario3_18_1_0Explanation": "No. It only prohibits turning right at the nearest intersection of roadways.",
  "gameSignScenario3_18_1_1Prompt": "Can I turn right at the nearest intersection?",
  "gameSignScenario3_18_1_1Explanation": "No. Turning right at the nearest intersection is prohibited.",
  "gameSignScenario3_18_2_0Prompt": "Is this sign prohibiting U-turns?",
  "gameSignScenario3_18_2_0Explanation": "No. It prohibits a left turn, but does not itself prohibit a U-turn.",
  "gameSignScenario3_18_2_1Prompt": "Can I turn left at the nearest intersection?",
  "gameSignScenario3_18_2_1Explanation": "No. Turning left at the nearest intersection is prohibited.",
  "gameSignScenario3_19_0Prompt": "Is this sign prohibiting left turns?",
  "gameSignScenario3_19_0Explanation": "No. It only prohibits turning around.",
  "gameSignScenario3_19_1Prompt": "Can you turn around in the area where this sign is active?",
  "gameSignScenario3_19_1Explanation": "No. U-turn is prohibited.",
  "gameSignScenario3_20_0Prompt": "Does this sign allow overtaking of a slow-moving vehicle with the appropriate sign?",
  "gameSignScenario3_20_0Explanation": "Yes. Low-speed vehicles are an exception to the prohibition of sign 3.20. Other overtaking prohibitions and markings also need to be taken into account.",
  "gameSignScenario3_20_1Prompt": "Is it possible to overtake a regular passenger car if it travels only 25 km/h?",
  "gameSignScenario3_20_1Explanation": "No. Low speed does not make a passenger car a slow-moving vehicle.",
  "gameSignScenario3_20_2Prompt": "Does this sign allow overtaking of a motorcycle without a sidecar?",
  "gameSignScenario3_20_2Explanation": "Yes. Two-wheeled motorcycles without a side trailer are an exception to the prohibition of this sign.",
  "gameSignScenario3_24_0Prompt": "Is the number on the sign the maximum speed limit?",
  "gameSignScenario3_24_0Explanation": "Yes. You cannot go faster than this. If visibility is poor, the safe speed may be lower.",
  "gameSignScenario3_24_1Prompt": "Does this sign require you to drive no slower than the indicated number?",
  "gameSignScenario3_24_1Explanation": "No. This is a maximum speed limit, not a minimum speed limit.",
  "gameSignScenario3_27_0Prompt": "Can a regular car stop for a minute to let a passenger out?",
  "gameSignScenario3_27_0Explanation": "No. The sign prohibits stopping and parking. Disembarking a passenger is also a stop.",
  "gameSignScenario3_27_1Prompt": "Does the “Disabled Person” sign itself allow you to stop here?",
  "gameSignScenario3_27_1Explanation": "No. The benefit itself does not cancel the “No Stopping” sign. An exception may be indicated by plate 8.18.",
  "gameSignScenario3_27_2Prompt": "Can I park a regular car under this sign?",
  "gameSignScenario3_27_2Explanation": "No. The sign prohibits both stopping and parking.",
  "gameSignScenario3_28_0Prompt": "Can I stop to drop off a passenger?",
  "gameSignScenario3_28_0Explanation": "Yes. The sign prohibits parking, but allows stopping. The time required for boarding, disembarking or loading may exceed 5 minutes.",
  "gameSignScenario3_28_1Prompt": "Can I leave a regular car for 20 minutes, without getting in or loading?",
  "gameSignScenario3_28_1Explanation": "No. This is a parking: a stop for more than 5 minutes, not related to boarding, disembarking or loading (clause 1.2).",
  "gameSignScenario3_28_2Prompt": "Does this prohibition apply to a car with a \"Disabled Person\" sign that is eligible for the benefit?",
  "gameSignScenario3_28_2Explanation": "No. If you have the right to free parking and a “Disabled Person” sign, an exception is provided, including the transportation of such disabled people and children with disabilities.",
  "gameSignScenario3_29_0Prompt": "Prohibition signs on even and odd days are on both sides. Can I park from 21:00 to 24:00?",
  "gameSignScenario3_29_0Explanation": "Yes. With this combination of signs, from 21:00 to 24:00 is the time of reshuffling, when parking is allowed on both sides.",
  "gameSignScenario3_29_1Prompt": "Does this sign prohibit stopping for 3 minutes to pick up a passenger?",
  "gameSignScenario3_29_1Explanation": "No. It only prohibits parking on odd numbers. Stopping is permitted.",
  "gameSignScenario3_31_0Prompt": "Does this sign eliminate overtaking and speed restrictions?",
  "gameSignScenario3_31_0Explanation": "Yes. It completes the action of signs 3.16, 3.20, 3.22, 3.24 and 3.26–3.30.",
  "gameSignScenario3_31_1Prompt": "Does this sign override traffic signals and markings?",
  "gameSignScenario3_31_1Explanation": "No. Traffic lights and markings continue to operate.",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_1_0Prompt": "The sign is at the beginning of the site. Can I turn right into the courtyard?",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_1_0Explanation": "Yes. At the beginning of the site, the sign is valid until the nearest intersection, but allows a right turn into the adjacent territory.",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_1_1Prompt": "The sign is in front of the intersection. Can I turn left?",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_1_1Explanation": "No. At the nearest intersection of roadways, only straight traffic is allowed.",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_2_0Prompt": "Do you need to turn right at the next intersection?",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_2_0Explanation": "Yes. For a regular car, the sign only allows right turns.",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_2_1Prompt": "Can you go straight at the nearest intersection?",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_2_1Explanation": "No. The sign allows only to the right.",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_3_0Prompt": "Does this sign allow a U-turn?",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_3_0Explanation": "Yes. A sign permitting a left turn also permits a U-turn.",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_3_1Prompt": "Can you go straight at the nearest intersection?",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_3_1Explanation": "No. The sign allows left and U-turn.",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_4_0Prompt": "Can you go straight or right?",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_4_0Explanation": "Yes. The sign allows both of these directions.",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_4_1Prompt": "Can I turn around at the nearest intersection?",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_4_1Explanation": "No. Allowed only straight ahead and to the right.",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_5_0Prompt": "Is it possible to turn around from the leftmost lane?",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_5_0Explanation": "Yes. A permitted left turn also allows for a U-turn.",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_5_1Prompt": "Can I turn right at the nearest intersection?",
  "gameSignScenario4_1_5_1Explanation": "No. The sign allows straight ahead, left and U-turn.",
  "gameSignScenario4_2_1_0Prompt": "Do you need to go around an obstacle on the right?",
  "gameSignScenario4_2_1_0Explanation": "Yes. Detour is allowed only from the direction indicated by the arrow.",
  "gameSignScenario4_2_1_1Prompt": "Is it possible to go around an obstacle on the left if there are no oncoming people?",
  "gameSignScenario4_2_1_1Explanation": "No. The absence of oncoming traffic does not cancel the prescribed detour direction.",
  "gameSignScenario4_3_0Prompt": "Should you drive around in the direction of the arrows?",
  "gameSignScenario4_3_0Explanation": "Yes. The sign specifies the direction of the circular motion.",
  "gameSignScenario4_3_1Prompt": "Can you drive in a circle against the arrows?",
  "gameSignScenario4_3_1Explanation": "No. They drive in a circle only in the direction indicated by the arrows.",
  "gameSignScenario4_6_0Prompt": "Does this sign set the minimum speed?",
  "gameSignScenario4_6_0Explanation": "Yes. You can drive at the specified speed or higher while respecting the maximum limit and safety.",
  "gameSignScenario4_6_1Prompt": "Does this sign indicate the maximum speed?",
  "gameSignScenario4_6_1Explanation": "No. This is the minimum speed. The maximum is limited by the sign 3.24.",
  "gameSignScenario5_1_0Prompt": "Passenger car without trailer: general limit on the motorway 110 km/h?",
  "gameSignScenario5_1_0Explanation": "Yes. The general limit for a passenger car without a trailer is 110 km/h. Signs may set a different limit (clause 10.3).",
  "gameSignScenario5_1_1Prompt": "Can you reverse on the motorway?",
  "gameSignScenario5_1_1Explanation": "No. On the highway, reversing is prohibited (clause 16.1).",
  "gameSignScenario5_1_2Prompt": "Is a moped allowed on the motorway?",
  "gameSignScenario5_1_2Explanation": "No. The movement of mopeds on highways is prohibited (clause 16.1).",
  "gameSignScenario5_3_0Prompt": "Is reversing prohibited on this road?",
  "gameSignScenario5_3_0Explanation": "Yes. On the road for cars, the prohibitions of section 16 apply, as on the highway (clause 16.3).",
  "gameSignScenario5_3_1Prompt": "Can I stop on the side of the road just to relax?",
  "gameSignScenario5_3_1Explanation": "No. Intentional stopping is allowed in special areas. A forced stop is a separate case.",
  "gameSignScenario5_5_0Prompt": "Is it possible to back up on a one-way road if it is safe and the place allows it?",
  "gameSignScenario5_5_0Explanation": "Yes. The sign itself does not prohibit this. You cannot reverse at intersections, crossings and other places from paragraphs. 8.11–8.12.",
  "gameSignScenario5_5_1Prompt": "Can I turn around and drive against one-way traffic?",
  "gameSignScenario5_5_1Explanation": "No. This is movement against the established direction.",
  "gameSignScenario5_5_2Prompt": "In a populated area, is it possible to park a passenger car on the left on a one-way road?",
  "gameSignScenario5_5_2Explanation": "Yes. For a passenger car this is permitted if there are no other prohibitions (clause 12.1).",
  "gameSignScenario5_14_1_0Prompt": "Can taxis and school buses use this lane?",
  "gameSignScenario5_14_1_0Explanation": "Yes. Clause 18.2 allows passenger taxis and school buses. Cyclists can only use this lane on the right.",
  "gameSignScenario5_14_1_1Prompt": "Is it possible for an ordinary passenger car to drive along the bus lane along the road?",
  "gameSignScenario5_14_1_1Explanation": "No. Regular cars are prohibited from driving in the lane. Changing lanes for a turn, entering and disembarking with intermittent markings are certain exceptions.",
  "gameSignScenario5_15_1_0Prompt": "Does the left arrow from the leftmost lane also allow for a U-turn?",
  "gameSignScenario5_15_1_0Explanation": "Yes. A turn is allowed from the leftmost lane if the sign allows a left turn from it.",
  "gameSignScenario5_19_1_0Prompt": "Without a traffic light, do you need to give way to a pedestrian crossing your road?",
  "gameSignScenario5_19_1_0Explanation": "Yes. At an unregulated crossing, you must give way to pedestrians crossing or entering the roadway (clause 14.1).",
  "gameSignScenario5_19_1_1Prompt": "Can you back up at a pedestrian crossing?",
  "gameSignScenario5_19_1_1Explanation": "No. At the crossing, both reversing and turning around are prohibited (clauses 8.11–8.12).",
  "gameSignScenario5_19_1_2Prompt": "Can you stop 3 m before crossing?",
  "gameSignScenario5_19_1_2Explanation": "No. Stopping is prohibited at the crossing and closer than 5 m in front of it (clause 12.4).",
  "gameSignScenario5_20_0Prompt": "Does the sign indicate the start of a speed bump?",
  "gameSignScenario5_20_0Explanation": "Yes. It is installed at the nearest border of the artificial roughness.",
  "gameSignScenario5_20_1Prompt": "Do you have to stop before an artificial hump?",
  "gameSignScenario5_20_1Explanation": "No. The sign does not require stopping. Select a safe speed to travel.",
  "gameSignScenario5_21_0Prompt": "Do pedestrians have priority in residential areas?",
  "gameSignScenario5_21_0Explanation": "Yes. Pedestrians can walk on the sidewalk and along the roadway, but should not unreasonably interfere with cars (clause 17.1).",
  "gameSignScenario5_21_1Prompt": "Is it possible to drive through a residential area at a speed of 30 km/h?",
  "gameSignScenario5_21_1Explanation": "No. In residential areas and in the yard the limit is 20 km/h (clause 10.2).",
  "gameSignScenario5_21_2Prompt": "Is it possible to drive through a residential area to shorten the route?",
  "gameSignScenario5_21_2Explanation": "No. Through traffic in a residential area is prohibited (clause 17.2).",
  "gameSignScenario5_23_1_0Prompt": "After this sign the general speed limit is 60 km/h?",
  "gameSignScenario5_23_1_0Explanation": "Yes. This is where the rules for the locality begin. The general limit is 60 km/h, unless another is established (clause 10.2).",
  "gameSignScenario5_23_1_1Prompt": "Is it possible to drive 90 km/h immediately after this sign without other signs?",
  "gameSignScenario5_23_1_1Explanation": "No. The general locality limit is 60 km/h.",
  "gameSignScenario5_25_0Prompt": "Does this sign itself introduce a 60 km/h limit?",
